---
const currentYear = new Date().getFullYear();
---

<footer class="bg-surface-900 text-slate-300 mt-20 border-t border-slate-800">
  <div class="max-w-content mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-12">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-4 gap-8">
      
      <!-- Brand & Mission -->
      <div class="space-y-4 md:col-span-1">
        <div class="flex items-center space-x-2">
          <div class="w-7 h-7 rounded bg-brand-500 text-white flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-sm">
            ⚡
          </div>
          <span class="text-white font-bold text-lg tracking-tight">机场推荐指南</span>
        </div>
        <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
          专注于中文科学上网机场节点评测、性价比梯子排行榜、客户端教程与网络安全知识普及。坚持客观严谨，拒绝虚构数据与虚假测试。
        </p>
        <div class="text-xs text-slate-500">
          官方正式域名：<span class="text-slate-300 font-mono">jichangtuijian.site</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Section Navigation -->
      <div>
        <h3 class="text-sm font-semibold text-white tracking-wider uppercase mb-4">内容专题</h3>
        <ul class="space-y-2 text-sm">
          <li><a href="/recommend/" class="hover:text-white transition-colors">机场推荐总览</a></li>
          <li><a href="/recommend/budget/" class="hover:text-white transition-colors">高性价比/便宜机场</a></li>
          <li><a href="/recommend/premium/" class="hover:text-white transition-colors">高端IPLC专线推荐</a></li>
          <li><a href="/recommend/ai/" class="hover:text-white transition-colors">ChatGPT/Claude AI节点</a></li>
          <li><a href="/recommend/streaming/" class="hover:text-white transition-colors">4K流媒体解锁专区</a></li>
          <li><a href="/ranking/overall/" class="hover:text-white transition-colors">综合实力排行榜</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <!-- Guides & Compare -->
      <div>
        <h3 class="text-sm font-semibold text-white tracking-wider uppercase mb-4">教程与工具</h3>
        <ul class="space-y-2 text-sm">
          <li><a href="/compare/" class="hover:text-white transition-colors">机场参数横向对比工具</a></li>
          <li><a href="/guides/windows/" class="hover:text-white transition-colors">Windows 客户端配置教程</a></li>
          <li><a href="/guides/android/" class="hover:text-white transition-colors">Android 客户端配置教程</a></li>
          <li><a href="/guides/ios/" class="hover:text-white transition-colors">iOS 小火箭/Loon 教程</a></li>
          <li><a href="/guides/macos/" class="hover:text-white transition-colors">macOS Clash/Sing-box 教程</a></li>
          <li><a href="/glossary/" class="hover:text-white transition-colors">网络知识与术语百科</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <!-- Trust, Legal & Bing Webmaster -->
      <div>
        <h3 class="text-sm font-semibold text-white tracking-wider uppercase mb-4">网站准则与声明</h3>
        <ul class="space-y-2 text-sm">
          <li><a href="/about/" class="hover:text-white transition-colors">关于本站</a></li>
          <li><a href="/editorial-policy/" class="hover:text-white transition-colors">独立编辑政策与评测依据</a></li>
          <li><a href="/disclaimer/" class="hover:text-white transition-colors">免责声明与合规提醒</a></li>
          <li><a href="/privacy-policy/" class="hover:text-white transition-colors">隐私保护政策</a></li>
          <li><a href="/contact/" class="hover:text-white transition-colors">联系方式与反馈通道</a></li>
          <li><a href="/sitemap-index.xml" class="hover:text-white transition-colors text-brand-400">XML 网站地图 (Sitemap)</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>

    </div>

    <!-- Editorial disclosure bar -->
    <div class="mt-10 pt-6 border-t border-slate-800 text-xs text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
      <p class="mb-2">
        <strong class="text-slate-300">透明度披露：</strong>本站包含部分机场服务商的推广邀请链接（Affiliate Links）。当您通过本站链接注册或订购服务时，我们可能获得少量佣金维持服务器运营与自动化监控节点支出，但这绝不会影响我们在排行榜与评测文章中的客观事实判定。所有评测数据均公开测试方法与数据来源。
      </p>
      <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center justify-between text-slate-500 pt-4 border-t border-slate-800/60">
        <p>© {currentYear} jichangtuijian.site 版权所有. 专注于中文科学上网与节点评测.</p>
        <p class="mt-2 sm:mt-0 font-mono text-[11px]">Powered by Astro · Hosted on Cloudflare Pages</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
